cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this book or its code, please cite it as below."
title: "Offline RL: From Theory to Industrial Practice"
abstract: >-
  Applied notes on offline reinforcement learning, in English and Russian:
  behavioral cloning, off-policy evaluation, conservative and implicit value
  learning, policy constraints, Decision Transformers, model-based methods,
  physics-informed control, an industrial case study with multi-seed
  ablations, explainability, and tool-using LLM agents, with runnable PyTorch
  code for every chapter.
type: software
